          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are fastidious about keeping clean. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against diseases. If you roll a success on a saving throw against a disease, you get a critical success instead. If you have a different ability that would improve the save in this way (such as the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Battle Hardened] fighter class feature), if you roll a critical failure on the save you get a failure instead.</p>"
          },
